@startuml
title Team AI Platform 数据主权与持久化边界图

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

package "身份与认证域" {
  database "Casdoor DB\nPostgreSQL:CASDOOR_DB_NAME" as CasDB2
  rectangle "主数据归属: Casdoor" as CasOwner
}

package "模型治理域" {
  database "NEW-API DB\nPostgreSQL:NEW_API_DB_NAME" as NewApiDB2
  database "Redis\n缓存 / 限流辅助" as Redis2
  rectangle "主数据归属: NEW-API" as NewApiOwner
}

package "聊天体验域" {
  database "LibreChat MongoDB\n数据库名: LibreChat" as Mongo2
  rectangle "主数据归属: LibreChat" as LibreOwner
}

artifact "runtime/local/new-api/postgres\nruntime/prod/new-api/postgres" as PgVolume
artifact "runtime/local/new-api/redis\nruntime/prod/new-api/redis" as RedisVolume
artifact "runtime/local/librechat/mongodb\nruntime/prod/librechat/mongodb" as MongoVolume
artifact "runtime/local/librechat/uploads\nruntime/prod/librechat/uploads" as UploadVolume
artifact "runtime/local/casdoor/logs\nruntime/prod/casdoor/logs" as CasLogs
artifact "runtime/local/new-api/logs\nruntime/prod/new-api/logs" as NewApiLogs
artifact "runtime/local/librechat/logs\nruntime/prod/librechat/logs" as LibreLogs

CasOwner --> CasDB2 : 保存
CasOwner --> CasLogs : 写日志

NewApiOwner --> NewApiDB2 : 保存
NewApiOwner --> Redis2 : 缓存
NewApiOwner --> NewApiLogs : 写日志

LibreOwner --> Mongo2 : 保存
LibreOwner --> UploadVolume : 文件上传
LibreOwner --> LibreLogs : 写日志

CasDB2 --> PgVolume : 持久化
NewApiDB2 --> PgVolume : 持久化
Redis2 --> RedisVolume : 持久化
Mongo2 --> MongoVolume : 持久化

note bottom of CasOwner
Casdoor 负责:
- 用户账号
- 手机号 / 邮箱
- 密码
- 组织 / 应用
- Provider
- OIDC 配置

对 OpenID 用户而言:
- 删除 / 禁用 / 改密码应优先在 Casdoor
end note

note bottom of NewApiOwner
NEW-API 负责:
- 渠道
- 模型矩阵
- model_mapping
- 服务 token
- 服务用户额度
- 限流配置
- 请求日志 / 审计
end note

note bottom of LibreOwner
LibreChat 负责:
- 本地用户镜像
- 对话 / 消息
- 智能体
- Prompt
- 文件与上传引用

OpenID 登录用户首次成功登录后
才会在 Mongo 中生成本地用户镜像
end note

legend right
= 审计结论 =
1. 身份主权与模型治理被明确拆分
2. LibreChat 不持有上游模型供应商密钥
3. PostgreSQL 是共享实例, 但不是共享同一逻辑库
4. MongoDB 仅负责聊天体验数据, 不应作为认证事实源
endlegend

@enduml
